---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout 
  title="About | Sercan Kara" 
  description="Senior Backend Architect and Systems Engineer with 13+ years of experience in distributed systems, cloud migrations, and high-throughput architectures."
>
  <section class="max-w-2xl mx-auto py-8 space-y-12">
    <!-- Header / Manifesto -->
    <header class="space-y-4">
      <h1 class="text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-zinc-900 dark:text-zinc-100">
        About
      </h1>
      <p class="text-lg text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400 leading-relaxed font-serif italic">
        "Pragmatic architecture over buzzwords, zero-downtime migrations, and resilient systems that quietly do their job."
      </p>
    </header>

    <!-- Narrative -->
    <article class="prose prose-zinc dark:prose-invert leading-relaxed space-y-4 text-zinc-700 dark:text-zinc-300">
      <p>
        I'm <strong>Sercan Kara</strong>, a Senior Backend Architect and Independent Developer based in Istanbul. 
        For over 13 years, I have been designing, scaling, and maintaining backend infrastructures—ranging 
        from high-throughput e-commerce microservices to security-critical network management software.
      </p>
      <p>
        My core expertise centers around <strong>Go, PHP, Docker, and Kubernetes</strong>. Over the years, 
        I've led foundational migrations from monoliths to microservices, orchestrated zero-downtime cloud 
        transitions (AWS to GCP), and built unified logistics infrastructures integrating dozens of external providers.
      </p>
      <p>
        Today, as an independent developer and backend architect, I focus on building resilient B2B SaaS 
        platforms, high-performance captive portal and log engines compliant with strict regulations, and 
        developer-first API services.
      </p>
    </article>

    <!-- Experience Timeline -->
    <div class="space-y-6">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-medium tracking-tight text-zinc-900 dark:text-zinc-100">
        Experience
      </h2>

      <div class="space-y-8 border-l border-zinc-200 dark:border-zinc-800 pl-4 ml-1">
        <div class="relative group">
          <div class="absolute -left-[21px] top-1.5 w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-zinc-400 dark:bg-zinc-600 group-hover:bg-zinc-900 dark:group-hover:bg-zinc-100 transition-colors"></div>
          <span class="text-xs font-mono text-zinc-500 uppercase tracking-wider">June 2025 — Present</span>
          <h3 class="text-base font-semibold text-zinc-900 dark:text-zinc-100 mt-0.5">Independent Software Developer & Architect</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400 mt-1">
            Architecting multi-tenant SaaS platforms (Customer Support & ITSM portals), high-throughput 5651 log compliance engines using Go, PHP, and ClickHouse, and self-hosted deployments via Dokploy and Coolify.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="relative group">
          <div class="absolute -left-[21px] top-1.5 w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-zinc-400 dark:bg-zinc-600 group-hover:bg-zinc-900 dark:group-hover:bg-zinc-100 transition-colors"></div>
          <span class="text-xs font-mono text-zinc-500 uppercase tracking-wider">Dec 2021 — May 2025</span>
          <h3 class="text-base font-semibold text-zinc-900 dark:text-zinc-100 mt-0.5">Senior Software Developer — FLO Mağazacılık</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400 mt-1">
            Decomposed the core e-commerce monolith into a scalable Stock Microservice. Co-architected the large-scale AWS to GCP cloud migration. Engineered a zero-downtime logistics pipeline supporting 10+ cargo providers and optimized same-day delivery microservices using Kubernetes, Go, PHP, and Couchbase.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="relative group">
          <div class="absolute -left-[21px] top-1.5 w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-zinc-400 dark:bg-zinc-600 group-hover:bg-zinc-900 dark:group-hover:bg-zinc-100 transition-colors"></div>
          <span class="text-xs font-mono text-zinc-500 uppercase tracking-wider">March 2018 — Dec 2021</span>
          <h3 class="text-base font-semibold text-zinc-900 dark:text-zinc-100 mt-0.5">Senior Software Developer — Inforelics Yazılım</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400 mt-1">
            Developed centralized Hotspot, firewall, and access point management software deployed across municipalities and public institutions. Managed CI/CD release cycles and low-level Linux/socket network services.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="relative group">
          <div class="absolute -left-[21px] top-1.5 w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-zinc-400 dark:bg-zinc-600 group-hover:bg-zinc-900 dark:group-hover:bg-zinc-100 transition-colors"></div>
          <span class="text-xs font-mono text-zinc-500 uppercase tracking-wider">Aug 2013 — March 2018</span>
          <h3 class="text-base font-semibold text-zinc-900 dark:text-zinc-100 mt-0.5">Senior Developer & Systems Specialist — Enkay Group</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400 mt-1">
            Established the in-house development unit, digitized retail sales operations via custom web portals, and managed mission-critical server environments.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Competencies Grid -->
    <div class="space-y-4">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-medium tracking-tight text-zinc-900 dark:text-zinc-100">
        Technical Competencies
      </h2>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4 text-sm">
        <div class="p-4 rounded-lg border border-zinc-200 dark:border-zinc-800 bg-zinc-50/50 dark:bg-zinc-900/40">
          <h3 class="font-medium text-zinc-900 dark:text-zinc-100 mb-1">Architecture & Backend</h3>
          <p class="text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400">Go, PHP, Microservices, Monolith Decomposition, Distributed Systems, Event-Driven Architecture, REST APIs.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="p-4 rounded-lg border border-zinc-200 dark:border-zinc-800 bg-zinc-50/50 dark:bg-zinc-900/40">
          <h3 class="font-medium text-zinc-900 dark:text-zinc-100 mb-1">Infrastructure & Cloud</h3>
          <p class="text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400">Kubernetes, Docker, GCP, AWS, Linux, Coolify, Dokploy, CI/CD, Zero-Downtime Deployment.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="p-4 rounded-lg border border-zinc-200 dark:border-zinc-800 bg-zinc-50/50 dark:bg-zinc-900/40">
          <h3 class="font-medium text-zinc-900 dark:text-zinc-100 mb-1">Databases & Storage</h3>
          <p class="text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400">MySQL, PostgreSQL, ClickHouse, Elasticsearch, Couchbase, Redis.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="p-4 rounded-lg border border-zinc-200 dark:border-zinc-800 bg-zinc-50/50 dark:bg-zinc-900/40">
          <h3 class="font-medium text-zinc-900 dark:text-zinc-100 mb-1">Open Source & Security</h3>
          <p class="text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400">Data Sanitization Packages (Go & PHP), 5651 Law Compliance, Server Benchmarks.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Connect / Links -->
    <div class="pt-4 border-t border-zinc-200 dark:border-zinc-800 space-y-3">
      <h2 class="text-base font-medium text-zinc-900 dark:text-zinc-100">Connect</h2>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-4 text-sm text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400">
        <a href="mailto:kara-sercan@hotmail.com" class="hover:text-zinc-900 dark:hover:text-zinc-100 underline underline-offset-4">kara-sercan@hotmail.com</a>
        <a href="https://linkedin.com/in/sercankara" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="hover:text-zinc-900 dark:hover:text-zinc-100 underline underline-offset-4">LinkedIn ↗</a>
        <a href="https://github.com/sewox" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="hover:text-zinc-900 dark:hover:text-zinc-100 underline underline-offset-4">GitHub ↗</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>